#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:5
#: 7fb33d2faff74c88a27db1bb694d6c7e
msgid "Rpanion 4G/LTE Telemetry Setup"
msgstr "Rpanion 4G/LTE 数传设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:7
#: e2e22bb3c8e94f7d9da6d2f1f15de918
msgid ""
"This page explains how to install and configure a 4G/LTE telemetry module "
"for use with Rpanion assuming :ref:`this setup <companion-computer-rpanion-"
"install>` has already been completed."
msgstr ""
"本页说明如何安装和配置用于 Rpanion 的 4G/LTE 数传模块，假定 :ref:`此设置 <companion-computer-"
"rpanion-install>` 已完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:9
#: 89cf07eb64c64b07b172b40048f88850
msgid ""
"`Rpanion's official VPN setup instructions are here "
"<https://www.docs.rpanion.com/software/rpanion_server_v012#vpn>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Rpanion 官方 VPN 设置说明见此处 "
"<https://www.docs.rpanion.com/software/rpanion_server_v012#vpn>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:12
#: bd827a0f116b46a48353dd87fb51721b
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:18
#: 1acd8e7c0727481baf65d3094b447cbb
msgid "LTE modem compatible with RPi.  Known working modems include:"
msgstr "与 RPi 兼容的 LTE 调制解调器。已知可用的调制解调器包括："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:20
#: 69f79d22e5544cf1a19cf440468488d5
msgid ""
"`FujiSoft FS040U LTE (Japan) "
"<https://www.amazon.co.jp/gp/product/B08H824QN7?psc=1>`__"
msgstr ""
"`FujiSoft FS040U LTE（日本） "
"<https://www.amazon.co.jp/gp/product/B08H824QN7?psc=1>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:21
#: 569dcfe60f714778b0e5adda680872d2
msgid ""
"`Quectel LTE EC25 Mini PCIe <https://www.quectel.com/product/lte-ec25-mini-"
"pcie-series/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Quectel LTE EC25 Mini PCIe <https://www.quectel.com/product/lte-ec25-mini-"
"pcie-series/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:23
#: fe87b3f6b0254659a76f10f124bb9b47
msgid ""
"A compatible SIM card like those from `IIJmio in Japan "
"<https://www.iijmio.jp/>`__ or  `Hologram <https://www.hologram.io/>`__"
msgstr ""
"兼容的 SIM 卡，例如 `日本 IIJmio <https://www.iijmio.jp/>`__ 或 `Hologram "
"<https://www.hologram.io/>`__ 提供的 SIM 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:24
#: 5f62fd9b51bd4e8696ecc4f7fb2e4f3c
msgid ""
"Custom cable to connect the `Ochin Tiny Carrier Board V2 "
"<https://www.seeedstudio.com/Ochin-Tiny-Carrier-Board-V2-for-Raspberry-Pi-"
"CM4-p-5887.html>`__ to the 4G/LTE modem"
msgstr ""
"用于将 `Ochin Tiny Carrier Board V2 <https://www.seeedstudio.com/Ochin-Tiny-"
"Carrier-Board-V2-for-Raspberry-Pi-CM4-p-5887.html>`__ 连接到 4G/LTE 调制解调器的定制线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:27
#: 97b6a2b6ed1347d0a74fc912265bbf4d
msgid "Install ZeroTier on Rpanion"
msgstr "在 Rpanion 上安装 ZeroTier"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:29
#: 8ccacbaaae4f4aa9a47c703dd4ae19aa
msgid ""
"If using Rpanion Server ver 0.12 (or earlier) ZeroTier must be installed "
"manually"
msgstr "如果使用 Rpanion Server 0.12 版（或更早版本），必须手动安装 ZeroTier"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:31
#: 7918013905ba4cca8f8ae4f43d85b820
msgid "Mount the RPI CM4/CM5 on the RPI I/O board"
msgstr "将 RPI CM4/CM5 安装到 RPI I/O 板上"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:32
#: b0196467250d45c0801712776a2815f7
msgid ""
"Ensure the jumper is removed so the RPI starts normally (e.g. no jumper on "
"\"Fit jumper to disable eMMC Boot\")"
msgstr "确保已移除跳线，使 RPI 正常启动（即「Fit jumper to disable eMMC Boot」上没有跳线）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:33
#: 6dcf02b6ddf041c5adf35db886e69f1d
msgid ""
"Connect an Ethernet cable to the I/O board so that it has internet access"
msgstr "将以太网线连接到 I/O 板，使其可以访问互联网"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:34
#: eaf09b1a820b465481d77dd23b0c1f20
msgid "Power on the I/O board"
msgstr "给 I/O 板上电"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:35
#: 292c744a3b1849c496ef3faec751cf09
msgid ""
"On your PC, connect to the \"rpanion\" wifi access point (password is "
"\"rpanion123\")"
msgstr "在您的 PC 上，连接到「rpanion」wifi 接入点（密码为「rpanion123」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:36
#: b8fba5ecf4894933af17ed20634ffede
msgid ""
"Use Putty (or any similar terminal program) to connect to the RPI using SSH"
msgstr "使用 Putty（或任何类似的终端程序）通过 SSH 连接到 RPI"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:38
#: 4622e2f58da140f085164b65a01626a3
msgid "Host Name: 10.0.2.100"
msgstr "Host Name：10.0.2.100"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:39
#: fa09a00b03fb4f8bb5021cff6808b1af
msgid "Connection Type: SSH"
msgstr "Connection Type：SSH"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:40
#: ce333589e03741a4b8fcfe3694cea1f0
msgid "Port: 22"
msgstr "Port：22"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:41
#: 5bc9e175e5f442299f0436904e305342
msgid "Username/password: pi/raspberry"
msgstr "用户名/密码：pi/raspberry"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:42
#: 0e41d6d3b01d499b8368873e017a0bcf
msgid ""
"Install ZeroTier by entering, \"curl -s https://install.zerotier.com | sudo "
"bash\" (`official instructions are here "
"<https://www.zerotier.com/download/>`__)"
msgstr ""
"输入「curl -s https://install.zerotier.com | sudo bash」安装 ZeroTier（`官方说明见此处 "
"<https://www.zerotier.com/download/>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:43
#: cb6d36859c3249d48b33db1d2822159a
msgid "Type, \"sudo poweroff\" to power off the RPI"
msgstr "输入「sudo poweroff」关闭 RPI 电源"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:44
#: 4bb3223d963b4ab68e439ca265417b1a
msgid "Power off the I/O board"
msgstr "给 I/O 板断电"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:46
#: ebde6ecf91ef483fa7ee86a75d3fd701
msgid ""
"Mount the RPI CM4/CM5 back on the Ochin carrier board and continue with the "
"steps below"
msgstr "将 RPI CM4/CM5 装回 Ochin 载板，然后继续以下步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:49
#: d3dcb45b1ff14dd49722348a0a9a7ad3
msgid "ZeroTier Setup Part 1"
msgstr "ZeroTier 设置第一部分"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:51
#: 22be9869311e4fd7bbc89c185b682654
msgid "Create a ZeroTier account (see https://www.zerotier.com/)"
msgstr "创建 ZeroTier 账户（参见 https://www.zerotier.com/）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:52
#: 79001992b77e4aac96d179886ac3d695
msgid "Create a new ZeroTier network, record the Network ID"
msgstr "创建新的 ZeroTier 网络，记录网络 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:53
#: 110b0ae812834065a6472ecae4e10efd
msgid "On the PC:"
msgstr "在 PC 上："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:55
#: 21fd3e72a9794c26833c1e84559aef35
msgid "`Install ZeroTier <https://www.zerotier.com/download/>`__"
msgstr "`安装 ZeroTier <https://www.zerotier.com/download/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:57
#: 48a01b73daa54b1fb4a2b8428d51be7f
msgid "Start the ZeroTier App"
msgstr "启动 ZeroTier 应用"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:58
#: 4a09dd096f784e5f8bd508d40d825bfc
msgid ""
"On bottom right tray, select orange ZeroTier icon, Join new network, paste "
"in the Network ID"
msgstr "在右下角托盘，选择橙色 ZeroTier 图标，加入新网络，粘贴网络 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:61
#: 649a72d068114e9b8127f161ba64324f
msgid "Rpanion Setup"
msgstr "Rpanion 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:63
#: 7df10d5bddea4b95b7f6eb51f5311cf1
msgid ""
"Power on the vehicle and wait for the modem to connect to the 4G/LTE network"
msgstr "给飞行器上电，等待调制解调器连接到 4G/LTE 网络"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:64
#: d55378b95f304f95b735346e3bf4afad
msgid "Connect to the \"rpanion\" wifi access point (password is \"rpanion123\")"
msgstr "连接到「rpanion」wifi 接入点（密码为「rpanion123」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:65
#: 6325a86bfdc843879349a55d70bc206a
msgid ""
"Open a browser to http://10.0.2.100:3001/ and enter username: admin, pw: "
"admin"
msgstr "用浏览器打开 http://10.0.2.100:3001/ ，输入用户名 admin、密码 admin"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:66
#: 9e2f91a71dfa4a21b62bdc9c1fcc73c8
msgid "From the left menu select \"VPN Config\""
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「VPN Config」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:67
#: 5398a94899f0494aab93d60816f2c886
msgid ""
"In the \"Add new network by key\" field enter the Network ID recorded above "
"and push \"Add\""
msgstr "在「Add new network by key」字段中输入上面记录的 Network ID，然后按「Add」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:74
#: f650fc1b6711463fa022a0e9b4f5eb3c
msgid "ZeroTier Setup Part 2"
msgstr "ZeroTier 设置第二部分"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:76
#: d1dfa4a06657482b8c1cf43e068137fc
msgid ""
"From a web browser, open `zerotier.com <https://www.zerotier.com/>`__ and "
"\"Log In\".  The browser should automatically forward to "
"https://my.zerotier.com/"
msgstr ""
"在浏览器中打开 `zerotier.com <https://www.zerotier.com/>`__ 并「登录」。浏览器应自动跳转至 "
"https://my.zerotier.com/"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:77
#: 05a502f4ed7d4ea4b1a792d1b13e73fe
msgid "From the list of Networks, select the Network created in \"Part 1\" above"
msgstr "在网络列表中，选择上文「第一部分」中创建的网络"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:78
#: a4302c5295964ba693254b4fff93a9f5
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the “Members” area, and look for new entries corresponding to"
" the PC and vehicle"
msgstr "向下滚动到「成员」区域，查找对应 PC 和飞行器的新条目"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:79
#: 04f50301127b4f328bf4649df6da9834
msgid ""
"Check the “Auth?” column for each, then click on the \"Edit\" column and "
"fill in the \"Name\" field"
msgstr "勾选每条记录的「授权？」列，然后点击「编辑」列并填写「名称」字段"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:80
#: e38760ad099447079946be46a2b67540
msgid ""
"Optionally also change the \"IP Assignments\" field's last digit to an easy-"
"to-remember value between 1 and 255"
msgstr "可选地将「IP 分配」字段的最后一位数字更改为 1 到 255 之间易于记忆的值"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:81
#: 5ab45571d6a648588e5ad6b604c8866a
msgid "Copy the vehicle's \"Managed IP\" address (it will be needed below)"
msgstr "复制飞行器的「托管 IP」地址（后续步骤需要使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:84
#: 6084c3fa7c2a46e5aedf4bdcf59d46f8
msgid "Connecting with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:86
#: fd4d510dedad40e1b251dc2481834ad6
msgid "Ensure PC has internet access"
msgstr "确保 PC 能访问互联网"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:87
#: b7b32ed66dbb4fd69f355627d203b017
msgid "Start the ZeroTier App, from the bottom right tray, connect to network"
msgstr "启动 ZeroTier 应用，从右下角托盘连接到网络"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:88
#: 627dfef785f04e46910180b47ec3fd4f
msgid ""
"Open a web browser and enter the vehicle's IP address (see above) with "
"\":3001\" appended, the Rpanion web interface should appear"
msgstr "打开网页浏览器，输入飞行器的 IP 地址（见上文）并在末尾附加「:3001」，应会出现 Rpanion 网页界面"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:89
#: ff633cabba04421ba6dbdbef4207dc8f
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner, from the top-right drop-down select \"UDPCl\" and "
"press connect"
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner，从右上角下拉菜单选择「UDPCl」并按下 connect"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:91
#: 65b330493a3f4c6e843640929f6b4ad2
msgid "Enter host name/ip: enter IP address from above"
msgstr "输入主机名/IP：输入上面获得的 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:92
#: 8110de60459644c4bfec0e650439d5ab
msgid "Enter remote port: 14550"
msgstr "输入远程端口：14550"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:95
#: 283dda6eb0a44666b23fb92f66a26e38
msgid "Connecting with QGC"
msgstr "使用 QGC 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:97
#: f214e284b99d4276b70c6b53315261ec
msgid ""
"Use the same procedure as Mission Planner but if QGC does not automatically "
"connect"
msgstr "步骤与 Mission Planner 相同，但如果 QGC 未自动连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:99
#: 8ee73166fbd04ed3bd55b90548b67a24
msgid "Select top-left icon, Application Settings, Comm Links"
msgstr "选择左上角图标、应用设置、通信链路"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-rpanion-lte-telem.rst:100
#: 54098d4841cb41bb8098e64e38779dde
msgid ""
"Add, Name: vehicle, Type:UDPCl, Port:14550, Server Address:, Add Server, OK"
msgstr ""
"Add，Name: vehicle，Type: UDPCl，Port: 14550，Server Address:，Add Server，OK"
